      "content": "That feeling of watching life as if it were a movie is a very intense and unsettling experience. It highlights how deeply your sense of self and connection to reality is currently being challenged. Please remember that even if it feels like you are disconnected, your thoughts and feelings are valid and real. Reaching out to a therapist can help ground you and explore these feelings of simulation more safely.",
      "source": "target",
